{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794585420697,"sessionID":"ses_e2a62233effea9cf1XWr6LjlNB","part":{"partID":"prt_1d5a06001001Iezt7Ky6WvmoX7","sessionID":"ses_e2a62233effea9cf1XWr6LjlNB","messageID":"msg_1d5a03f1f001U6SKDe8b1Qrfhp","type":"tool","id":"call_4362ce0f61224958bdd367e8","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"rg -n 'doctor-phrase-reach|phrases=' specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/016-claude-create-reach-and-doctor-default/*.md | head -30","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research"},"output":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/016-claude-create-reach-and-doctor-default/spec.md:146:$ node $DS/doctor-phrase-reach.cjs | tail -1\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/016-claude-create-reach-and-doctor-default/spec.md:147:STATUS=OK phrases=248 bridges=36\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/016-claude-create-reach-and-doctor-default/tasks.md:42:- `CRS` is `node .skilled/bin/compiled-route-sync.cjs --check`, which must print `all 7 hubs resolve` and `all 55 served copies match their authored files`. `PSC` is `node $DS/parent-skill-check.cjs .skilled/skills/sk-doc`, whose last line must hold `all hard invariants passed`. `CCM` is `node $DS/command-catalog-mirror-check.cjs --check`, which must print `STATUS=OK`. `RV` is `bash $DS/route-validate.sh`, whose last line must hold `32 routes validated`. `DPR` is `node $DS/doctor-phrase-reach.cjs`, whose last line must start `STATUS=OK`.\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/016-claude-create-reach-and-doctor-default/tasks.md:81:- [x] T002 [C] Record the before numbers (`$SP/before.txt`). Run `G rev-parse --short HEAD`, `npm run build` in `ADV`, `FLOOR`, `REAL` into `$SP/real-head.json`, `EVAL`, `TC`, `VALL`, `DALL`, `DRV`, `SRM`, `NMST`, `PSY`, `ASY`, `AMSC`, `AMC`, `MAN`, `GPC`, `RCC`, `CRS`, `PSC`, `CCM`, `RV`, `DPR`, `OLD | wc -l`, `node $MBC --help 2>&1 | head -1` and `jq -c '.rows[\"cmd-doctor-mcp-plain-tune-01\"].offered, .rows[\"cmd-doctor-skill-advisor-plain-tune-01\"].offered' $BASE`, and write each command with its last output lines or exit code into the file. Verify: `FLOOR` prints `{\"correct\":24,\"total\":44}`, `{\"count\":0,\"total\":35}`, `{\"own\":24,\"attached\":20,\"combined\":44,\"total\":44}`, `{\"own\":8,\"attached\":15,\"combined\":23,\"total\":45}` and `{\"count\":0,\"total\":35}`, the `REAL` read prints typed `{\"correct\":24,\"total\":44}`, tune `{\"correct\":13,\"total\":45}`, holdout `{\"correct\":3,\"total\":44}`, false offers `{\"count\":0,\"total\":35}` twice and `[false,false,false]`, `EVAL` prints `[160,50,21,5]`, `TC` exits 0, `VALL` reports 0 failed, `DALL` reports `fail 0`, `DRV` prints `\"changed\": []`, `SRM` prints `visibility claude 32/44, cursor 44/44`, `NMST` reports `fail 0`, `PSY` prints `45` three times, `ASY` prints `11` three times, `AMSC` is in sync, `AMC` prints `STATUS=OK`, `MAN` prints `Budget: 16092 / 16384 bytes to the last anchor, 27575 / 32768 bytes total`, `GPC` and `RCC` pass, `CRS` prints both lines, `PSC` holds `all hard invariants passed`, `CCM` prints `STATUS=OK`, `RV` holds `32 routes validated`, `DPR` prints `STATUS=OK phrases=248 bridges=36`, `OLD | wc -l` prints 55 and the two rows print `false` and `false`. When a gate is red or a value differs from `spec.md` section 2, stop and mark the phase `[B]` with that line, because every later expected value quotes these.\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/016-claude-create-reach-and-doctor-default/tasks.md:116:- [ ] T019 [P] Lane D. Add intent phrases to the five scored commands that have no recommendation (`RTS`, `SSK` and the `DER` outputs). Take the phrases in `added` for `/doctor:install`, `/doctor:setup`, `/doctor:speckit`, `/doctor:update` and `/speckit:search` from `LIN`, and leave `/create:skill-parent` out. Before adding them, read the prompts of `cmd-doctor-install-plain-tune-01`, `cmd-doctor-setup-plain-tune-01`, `cmd-doctor-speckit-plain-tune-01`, `cmd-doctor-update-plain-tune-01` and `cmd-speckit-search-plain-tune-01` from `CORPUS` by id, each after checking that its `split` is `tune`. Compare each phrase with its command's tune prompt after lowercasing and collapsing spaces, and rewrite any phrase that equals that prompt or holds it whole as a paraphrase that keeps the intent words and changes the rest, because a phrase copied from a tune prompt counts as gain only on tune. Never read or compare a holdout row. Add the four doctor commands' phrases to `trigger_phrases` of their routes in `RTS` and the search phrases to `userIntent.ownedSignals` of `/speckit:search` in `SSK`, then run `DER`. Verify: a script that compares every added phrase with the five tune prompts on the same normalized text prints `0`, `RV` holds `32 routes validated`, `DPR` prints `STATUS=OK` with `phrases=` higher than `$SP/before.txt` by the number of doctor phrases added, `DRV` prints `\"changed\": []`, `jq empty $SSK` passes and `TC` exits 0.\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/016-claude-create-reach-and-doctor-default/spec.md:146:$ node $DS/doctor-phrase-reach.cjs | tail -1\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/016-claude-create-reach-and-doctor-default/spec.md:147:STATUS=OK phrases=248 bridges=36\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/016-claude-create-reach-and-doctor-default/tasks.md:42:- `CRS` is `node .skilled/bin/compiled-route-sync.cjs --check`, which must print `all 7 hubs resolve` and `all 55 served copies match their authored files`. `PSC` is `node $DS/parent-skill-check.cjs .skilled/skills/sk-doc`, whose last line must hold `all hard invariants passed`. `CCM` is `node $DS/command-catalog-mirror-check.cjs --check`, which must print `STATUS=OK`. `RV` is `bash $DS/route-validate.sh`, whose last line must hold `32 routes validated`. `DPR` is `node $DS/doctor-phrase-reach.cjs`, whose last line must start `STATUS=OK`.\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/016-claude-create-reach-and-doctor-default/tasks.md:81:- [x] T002 [C] Record the before numbers (`$SP/before.txt`). Run `G rev-parse --short HEAD`, `npm run build` in `ADV`, `FLOOR`, `REAL` into `$SP/real-head.json`, `EVAL`, `TC`, `VALL`, `DALL`, `DRV`, `SRM`, `NMST`, `PSY`, `ASY`, `AMSC`, `AMC`, `MAN`, `GPC`, `RCC`, `CRS`, `PSC`, `CCM`, `RV`, `DPR`, `OLD | wc -l`, `node $MBC --help 2>&1 | head -1` and `jq -c '.rows[\"cmd-doctor-mcp-plain-tune-01\"].offered, .rows[\"cmd-doctor-skill-advisor-plain-tune-01\"].offered' $BASE`, and write each command with its last output lines or exit code into the file. Verify: `FLOOR` prints `{\"correct\":24,\"total\":44}`, `{\"count\":0,\"total\":35}`, `{\"own\":24,\"attached\":20,\"combined\":44,\"total\":44}`, `{\"own\":8,\"attached\":15,\"combined\":23,\"total\":45}` and `{\"count\":0,\"total\":35}`, the `REAL` read prints typed `{\"correct\":24,\"total\":44}`, tune `{\"correct\":13,\"total\":45}`, holdout `{\"correct\":3,\"total\":44}`, false offers `{\"count\":0,\"total\":35}` twice and `[false,false,false]`, `EVAL` prints `[160,50,21,5]`, `TC` exits 0, `VALL` reports 0 failed, `DALL` reports `fail 0`, `DRV` prints `\"changed\": []`, `SRM` prints `visibility claude 32/44, cursor 44/44`, `NMST` reports `fail 0`, `PSY` prints `45` three times, `ASY` prints `11` three times, `AMSC` is in sync, `AMC` prints `STATUS=OK`, `MAN` prints `Budget: 16092 / 16384 bytes to the last anchor, 27575 / 32768 bytes total`, `GPC` and `RCC` pass, `CRS` prints both lines, `PSC` holds `all hard invariants passed`, `CCM` prints `STATUS=OK`, `RV` holds `32 routes validated`, `DPR` prints `STATUS=OK phrases=248 bridges=36`, `OLD | wc -l` prints 55 and the two rows print `false` and `false`. When a gate is red or a value differs from `spec.md` section 2, stop and mark the phase `[B]` with that line, because every later expected value quotes these.\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/016-claude-create-reach-and-doctor-default/tasks.md:116:- [ ] T019 [P] Lane D. Add intent phrases to the five scored commands that have no recommendation (`RTS`, `SSK` and the `DER` outputs). Take the phrases in `added` for `/doctor:install`, `/doctor:setup`, `/doctor:speckit`, `/doctor:update` and `/speckit:search` from `LIN`, and leave `/create:skill-parent` out. Before adding them, read the prompts of `cmd-doctor-install-plain-tune-01`, `cmd-doctor-setup-plain-tune-01`, `cmd-doctor-speckit-plain-tune-01`, `cmd-doctor-update-plain-tune-01` and `cmd-speckit-search-plain-tune-01` from `CORPUS` by id, each after checking that its `split` is `tune`. Compare each phrase with its command's tune prompt after lowercasing and collapsing spaces, and rewrite any phrase that equals that prompt or holds it whole as a paraphrase that keeps the intent words and changes the rest, because a phrase copied from a tune prompt counts as gain only on tune. Never read or compare a holdout row. Add the four doctor commands' phrases to `trigger_phrases` of their routes in `RTS` and the search phrases to `userIntent.ownedSignals` of `/speckit:search` in `SSK`, then run `DER`. Verify: a script that compares every added phrase with the five tune prompts on the same normalized text prints `0`, `RV` holds `32 routes validated`, `DPR` prints `STATUS=OK` with `phrases=` higher than `$SP/before.txt` by the number of doctor phrases added, `DRV` prints `\"changed\": []`, `jq empty $SSK` passes and `TC` exits 0.\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"rg -n 'doctor-phrase-reach|phrases='