quotes this block or that section.\n168: \n169: ### Rename Inventory\n[Output truncated. Continue reading with offset: 170]","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":true},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/016-claude-create-reach-and-doctor-default/spec.md, lines 130-169\n130: [agents-md-manifest] Budget: 16092 / 16384 bytes to the last anchor, 27575 / 32768 bytes total, 21 history bodies\n131: $ node .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-check.cjs | tail -1\n132: STATUS=OK rows=12 findings=0 unknown=0\n133: $ node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/sync-gate1-pointers.cjs --check\n134: [gate1-pointer-sync] PASS: 1 instruction files carry the root Gate 1 and Gate 2 pointers.\n135: $ node .skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-review/scripts/check-rule-copies.js | head -1\n136: OK: all rule invariants present (8 exact-string file(s) + 2 Iron Law file(s) + 21 delivery-prefix anchor(s) + 6 extension floor(s) + 2 example output(s)).\n137: $ node .skilled/bin/compiled-route-sync.cjs --check | tail -2\n138: all 7 hubs resolve\n139: all 55 served copies match their authored files\n140: $ node $DS/parent-skill-check.cjs .skilled/skills/sk-doc | tail -1 | grep -o 'all hard.*'\n141: all hard invariants passed, 0 warnings\n142: $ node $DS/command-catalog-mirror-check.cjs --check | grep STATUS\n143: STATUS=OK command-catalog-mirror: every catalog and hub metadata covers the command tree\n144: $ bash $DS/route-validate.sh 2>/dev/null | tail -1 | grep -o '[0-9]* routes.*'\n145: 32 routes validated, 11 warnings\n146: $ node $DS/doctor-phrase-reach.cjs | tail -1\n147: STATUS=OK phrases=248 bridges=36\n148: $ ls $SC/{codex/sync-prompts,pi/sync-prompts-pi,dsh/sync-prompts-dsh,codex/sync-agents,pi/sync-agents-pi,dsh/sync-agents-dsh}.cjs | xargs -n1 -I{} sh -c \"node {} --check | tail -1\"\n149: [codex-agent-sync] PASS: 11 agents are in sync.\n150: [codex-prompt-sync] PASS: 45 prompts are in sync.\n151: [dsh-agent-sync] PASS: 11 agent patches are in sync.\n152: [dsh-prompt-sync] PASS: 45 prompt stubs are in sync.\n153: [pi-agent-sync] PASS: 11 agents are in sync.\n154: [pi-prompt-sync] PASS: 45 prompts are in sync.\n155: $ node .skilled/bin/check-agent-mirror-sync.cjs 2>/dev/null | tail -1 | grep -o 'all comparable mirrors in sync'\n156: all comparable mirrors in sync\n157: $ sed -n 167p $ADV/scripts/measure-brief-cost.mjs\n158:     env: { ...process.env, SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_DIR: socketDir },\n159: $ grep -n -o \"DURABLE_METRICS_ROOT = join(tmpdir(), '[a-z-]*')\" $ADV/lib/metrics.ts\n160: 185:DURABLE_METRICS_ROOT = join(tmpdir(), 'speckit-skill-advisor-metrics')\n161: $ git -c core.fsmonitor=false tag --contains $(git -c core.fsmonitor=false log --diff-filter=A --format=%h -1 -- .skilled/skills/sk-doc/changelog/v2.9.13.0.md)\n162: v4.0.2.1\n163: $ git -c core.fsmonitor=false tag --contains $(git -c core.fsmonitor=false log --diff-filter=A --format=%h -1 -- .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/changelog/v1.0.0.0.md)\n164: v4.0.2.1\n165: ```\n166: \n167: From `research-segment-4.md` section 4 (a), rerun there at `087888ec4a` with `--real-embedding`: typed 24 of 44, plain tune top-1 13 of 45, plain tune with attached commands 28 of 45, plain holdout 3 of 44, false offers 0 of 35 and attached false offers 0 of 35. With the lineage's 23 phrases on copies of the database, holdout reads 5 of 44 and tune top-1 18 of 45, and for each command one phrase equals its tune prompt word for word. Every count in this spec quotes this block or that section.\n168: \n169: ### Rename Inventory\n[Output truncated. Continue reading with offset: 170]"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"limit\":40,\"offset\":130,\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-